From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 02:22:58 +0200
Subject: media: ov5640: Don't ignore PLL setup failure in set_mode

A failure to program the clock tree was returned as success, and it
also skipped restoring auto exposure/gain, which set_mode disabled
on entry.

Signed-off-by: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/ov5640.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/ov5640.c b/drivers/media/i2c/ov5640.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/ov5640.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/ov5640.c
@@ -2428,7 +2428,7 @@ static int ov5640_set_mode(struct ov5640_dev *sensor)
 	else
 		ret = ov5640_set_dvp_pclk(sensor);
 	if (ret < 0)
-		return 0;
+		goto restore_auto_exp_gain;
 
 	if ((dn_mode == SUBSAMPLING && orig_dn_mode == SCALING) ||
 	    (dn_mode == SCALING && orig_dn_mode == SUBSAMPLING)) {
-- 
Armbian

